{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.ResidueAtRoot","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.ResidueAtRoot","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.residue_of_product","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.residue_of_product","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/residue-at-root.lean#L32-L39","doc":"**Residue of product (conditional corollary).**\nThe cyclotomic residue of a product is the product of residues. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.residue_isRingHom_of_residueAtRoot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.residue_isRingHom_of_residueAtRoot","kind":"theorem","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/residue-at-root.lean#L22-L30","doc":"**Proposition (conditional on `conj:gs-residue-at-root-existence`).**\nGiven the cyclotomic-projection machinery `[ResidueAtRoot R]` (the\nclass axiomatisation of the existence conjecture), the residue at\nroot index `n` is well defined as the image under a ring\nhomomorphism into the target ring `ℤ[q]/Φ_n(q)`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:residue-at-root","label":"prop:residue-at-root","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/residue-at-root.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}